<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Olympia year net down 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Olympia year net down 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  44.78   vs	  69.30</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  9.0    vs	  16.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   479.60   vs	 573.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    80.45   vs	 108.39</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 11.05   vs  less   8.80</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	 5.0    vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Olympia Industries Bhd is mainly involved in gaming and property businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
